{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 756150,
  "courseSlug": "the-complete-guide-to-angular-2",
  "courseTitle": "Angular - The Complete Guide",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "44115924",
      "title": "Host Directives & Composition",
      "lectureOrder": 162,
      "videoOrder": 154,
      "sourceHash": "b793593c4cf082fee4b2f476f5fb33d64697635013c760f7400e4cadf5fd3f6f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.69,
          "end": 2.31,
          "en": "So you did now learn",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 5.28,
          "en": "how to build Structural Directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 5.28,
          "end": 8.643,
          "en": "and how to build Attribute Directives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 11.16,
          "en": "They are very similar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.16,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "but they differ in what they do to the element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 17.64,
          "en": "where you add them and they also differ",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 17.64,
          "end": 19.95,
          "en": "regarding how you use them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.95,
          "end": 23.55,
          "en": "Structural Directives are used on a NG template element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 23.55,
          "end": 26.58,
          "en": "or prefixed with this asterisk.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 26.58,
          "end": 29.19,
          "en": "Attribute Directives are simply added",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 29.19,
          "end": 32.37,
          "en": "as attributes onto elements like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 32.37,
          "end": 35.79,
          "en": "Now, it is possible that you have some directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 35.79,
          "end": 39.3,
          "en": "that maybe enhances an element in a way",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.3,
          "end": 44.22,
          "en": "that should be applied to multiple of your components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 44.22,
          "end": 47.22,
          "en": "So you have a directive and you have multiple components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 47.22,
          "end": 49.95,
          "en": "and maybe some of those components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.95,
          "end": 54.18,
          "en": "should have the same features that directive provides.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.18,
          "end": 57.42,
          "en": "To give you an example, I'll add a new directive here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.42,
          "end": 60.7,
          "en": "with NGGD and I'll name it log",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 61.95,
          "end": 64.173,
          "en": "and skip those tests.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 65.7,
          "end": 69.53999999999999,
          "en": "And that will just be some dummy directive I wanna add here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 69.53999999999999,
          "end": 74.31,
          "en": "And the idea behind this log directive is simply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 74.31,
          "end": 78.12,
          "en": "that I wanna add a click listener",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 78.12,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "to the host element where this directive is added to.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 85.26,
          "en": "And then trigger onLog method",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.26,
          "end": 89.22,
          "en": "which I'm adding here in this log directive class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 89.22,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "where I'll console log clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 95.1,
          "en": "And where I then also wanna log some details",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 95.1,
          "end": 97.533,
          "en": "about the host element that was clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.64,
          "end": 101.71000000000001,
          "en": "So I'll inject that host element reference",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 102.75,
          "end": 105.9,
          "en": "by using the inject function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.9,
          "end": 108.993,
          "en": "and injecting ElementRef as you learned it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 110.28,
          "end": 112.8,
          "en": "And then here we can also log this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 112.8,
          "end": 115.62,
          "en": "And in more advanced apps, we might be sending that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 115.62,
          "end": 118.473,
          "en": "to some backend server or do anything like that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 119.85,
          "end": 123.15,
          "en": "And now, we could, of course, add that to elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.15,
          "end": 126.72,
          "en": "We could add it to this paragraph here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.72,
          "end": 129.87,
          "en": "for example, this helpful resources you might want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 129.87,
          "end": 133.563,
          "en": "to use paragraph, we could add app log here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 134.88,
          "end": 136.95,
          "en": "And to make it available, we of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.95,
          "end": 141.06,
          "en": "then also need to add the log directive here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 141.06,
          "end": 145.263,
          "en": "to the imports of this learning resources component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 149.67000000000002,
          "en": "But we also might want to add that directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 149.67000000000002,
          "end": 152.28,
          "en": "on one of our own components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.28,
          "end": 154.53,
          "en": "So in the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 157.8,
          "en": "we might want to add appLog here directly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.8,
          "end": 160.74,
          "en": "on the app learning resources component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 160.74,
          "end": 163.77,
          "en": "so that when this component is clicked anywhere",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 163.77,
          "end": 166.44,
          "en": "in that component, we wanna log information",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 166.44,
          "end": 168.513,
          "en": "about this component host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.16,
          "end": 174.78,
          "en": "To make that work, we also have to import this log directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 174.78,
          "end": 178.44299999999998,
          "en": "and add it to the imports here in the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 181.17,
          "end": 185.46,
          "en": "With that done, if we reload, if we clear that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 185.46,
          "end": 190.46,
          "en": "you see, if I click on helpful resources, I get two logs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 190.8,
          "end": 193.26,
          "en": "One, with details about the paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 193.26,
          "end": 196.47,
          "en": "and one, with details about the component element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 196.47,
          "end": 197.943,
          "en": "which makes sense.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 199.89,
          "end": 203.28,
          "en": "But now, let's say we also wanna log clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 203.28,
          "end": 208.28,
          "en": "onto the app auth component and also clicks to elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 208.53,
          "end": 211.893,
          "en": "that use the app auth directive like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 212.94,
          "end": 216.84300000000002,
          "en": "We can, of course, add this directive in all these places,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 217.74,
          "end": 220.47,
          "en": "and if I reload, we therefore see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 220.47,
          "end": 222.48,
          "en": "that log here for app auth.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 223.47,
          "end": 227.4,
          "en": "And if I log in here as an admin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 227.4,
          "end": 231.36,
          "en": "and I click here, I get that log about this admin paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 231.36,
          "end": 235.86,
          "en": "Whereas I don't get that if I click on a regular guest user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 235.86,
          "end": 239.76,
          "en": "because I only added app log here on this first paragraph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 239.76,
          "end": 243.21,
          "en": "But whilst we can do all that, that is, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 243.21,
          "end": 245.4,
          "en": "quite a bit of repetition,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 245.4,
          "end": 249.57,
          "en": "having to add this directive here onto all these elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 249.57,
          "end": 253.02,
          "en": "and having to add it here to this imports array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 253.02,
          "end": 255.003,
          "en": "That is some repetition.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 255.84,
          "end": 260.61,
          "en": "And that's why Angular gives you a different mechanism",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 260.61,
          "end": 264.78,
          "en": "for situations like this where you might have a directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 264.78,
          "end": 267.72,
          "en": "that contains some functionality",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 267.72,
          "end": 270.3,
          "en": "that should be incorporated",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 270.3,
          "end": 273.123,
          "en": "by other directives or components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 274.44,
          "end": 276.54,
          "en": "So what we can do here is get rid",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 276.54,
          "end": 280.21,
          "en": "of that log directive import in the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 281.58,
          "end": 285.15999999999997,
          "en": "and get rid of the usage in the app component template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 286.02,
          "end": 288.93,
          "en": "in all the places where I did use it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 288.93,
          "end": 291.63,
          "en": "And with that changed,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 291.63,
          "end": 295.44,
          "en": "we can instead go to the auth component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 295.44,
          "end": 298.47,
          "en": "for example, and add a new property",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 298.47,
          "end": 301.863,
          "en": "to this component decorator configuration object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 303.06,
          "end": 307.263,
          "en": "We can add the host directives property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 308.13,
          "end": 310.62,
          "en": "and this takes an array of directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 310.62,
          "end": 314.19,
          "en": "that should be added to this host element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 314.19,
          "end": 317.25,
          "en": "And then no matter how often we use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 317.25,
          "end": 319.74,
          "en": "this component anywhere in this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 319.74,
          "end": 323.193,
          "en": "it will always have that directive added onto it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 324.3,
          "end": 327.93,
          "en": "So here it's then this log directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 327.93,
          "end": 331.953,
          "en": "which I'll add as a value for host directives like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 333.21,
          "end": 336.87,
          "en": "With that, if we save that, if we go back",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 336.87,
          "end": 339.54,
          "en": "and I click onto this auth component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 339.54,
          "end": 341.58,
          "en": "I still get that log here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 341.58,
          "end": 344.31,
          "en": "but now without adding the directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 344.31,
          "end": 346.47,
          "en": "on the host element in the template,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 346.47,
          "end": 348.36,
          "en": "but instead by using it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 348.36,
          "end": 350.763,
          "en": "with that host directives feature.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 352.53,
          "end": 354.51,
          "en": "And I could, for example, also use this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 354.51,
          "end": 358.38,
          "en": "in the safe link directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 358.38,
          "end": 361.99,
          "en": "There, we could also add host directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 362.97,
          "end": 365.193,
          "en": "and add the log directive here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 366.12,
          "end": 368.64,
          "en": "And if that directive would take any inputs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 368.64,
          "end": 371.7,
          "en": "we could set them here through this host option.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 371.7,
          "end": 374.703,
          "en": "But this directive doesn't take any inputs, so we're good.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 375.9,
          "end": 378.33,
          "en": "And now, any safe links would also have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 378.33,
          "end": 380.673,
          "en": "this logging behavior attached to them.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 382.29,
          "end": 385.2,
          "en": "Now, it's different for the auth directive though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 385.2,
          "end": 386.94,
          "en": "There, we could also add it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 386.94,
          "end": 389.4,
          "en": "But since this is a structural directive",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 389.4,
          "end": 392.31,
          "en": "and since in the end it will always end up",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 392.31,
          "end": 394.14,
          "en": "on a NG template element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 394.14,
          "end": 397.08299999999997,
          "en": "the log directive wouldn't have any effect here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 398.13,
          "end": 399.39,
          "en": "But the great thing is",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.39,
          "end": 403.02,
          "en": "that we can merge this host directives setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 403.02,
          "end": 405.693,
          "en": "with the regular usage of a directive.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 406.74,
          "end": 409.2,
          "en": "So we could still go back to the app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 409.2,
          "end": 412.02,
          "en": "and bring back the log directive here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 412.02,
          "end": 415.53,
          "en": "still import it and add it to imports,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 415.53,
          "end": 419.31,
          "en": "and still use it in the template where needed, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 419.31,
          "end": 423.3,
          "en": "here on this paragraph,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 423.3,
          "end": 426.54,
          "en": "whilst at the same time deeply incorporating it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 426.54,
          "end": 429.573,
          "en": "into some elements like this auth component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 430.74,
          "end": 432.72,
          "en": "so that now if I go back and reload,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 432.72,
          "end": 436.65,
          "en": "if I click here, I get this output for the auth component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 436.65,
          "end": 437.483,
          "en": "But for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 437.483,
          "end": 441.483,
          "en": "also for all these safe links, as you can tell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 443.4,
          "end": 446.31,
          "en": "And that's, therefore, also a feature you should be aware of",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 446.31,
          "end": 449.55,
          "en": "because that allows you to compose directives",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 449.55,
          "end": 453.27,
          "en": "or components by merging behaviors",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 453.27,
          "end": 455.49,
          "en": "and features that have been defined",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 455.49,
          "end": 457.773,
          "en": "in other directives with each other.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
